upon their knees.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":68,"sd":null},{"k":"19:69","t":"Then We will surely extract from every sect those of them who were worst against the Most Merciful in insolence.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"19:70","t":"Then, surely it is We who are most knowing of those most worthy of burning therein.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":70,"sd":null},{"k":"19:71","t":"And there is none of you except he will come to it. This is upon your Lord an inevitability decreed.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":71,"sd":null},{"k":"19:72","t":"Then We will save those who feared Allāh and leave the wrongdoers within it, on their knees.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":72,"sd":null},{"k":"19:73","t":"And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who disbelieve say to those who believe, \"Which of [our] two parties is best in position and best in association?\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":73,"sd":null},{"k":"19:74","t":"And how many a generation have We destroyed before them who were better in possessions and [outward] appearance?","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"19:75","t":"Say, \"Whoever is in error - let the Most Merciful extend for him an extension [in wealth and time] until, when they see that which they were promised - either punishment [in this world] or the Hour [of resurrection] - they will come to know who is worst in position and weaker in soldiers.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"19:76","t":"And Allāh increases those who were guided, in guidance, and the enduring good deeds are better to your Lord for reward and better for recourse.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":76,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":31,"surahs":[19],"sajdah":false}